  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This concerns a continued core-support to the Office of the High Commissioner for Human Rights in Cambodia. The amount for 2003 includes an amount for the special election project, general election will take place in July 2003. However, no money has been earmarked for this, instead there is an increas of the total. The decision and assesment is made together for OHCHR support to Geneva &amp; Colombia.</narrative>
